//! # Raw Benchmarks
//!
//! ```text
//! test f32_dtoa      ... bench:   1,174,070 ns/iter (+/- 442,501)
//! test f32_lexical   ... bench:   1,433,234 ns/iter (+/- 633,261)
//! test f32_ryu       ... bench:     669,828 ns/iter (+/- 192,291)
